---
layout: page
---
{% comment %}
  Lecture schedule layout, driven by _data/lectures/<year>.yml.

  Set `year: "2026"` in the page front matter for a single offering, or
  `years: ["2025", "2024"]` for an archive page listing several offerings,
  each under its own heading, in the order given.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="post">
  {{ content }}

  {% if page.year %}
    {% include lecture_table.liquid year=page.year %}
  {% endif %}

  {% for archived_year in page.years %}
    <h3 id="{{ archived_year }}">{{ archived_year }}</h3>
    {% include lecture_table.liquid year=archived_year %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
